entries.text:
Words are engraved on the statue:{VAR BE01}
“Four great warriors form
 this Pokémon League.{VAR BE01}
 To the southwest is one who
 does not fear the Ghost type.{VAR BE01}
 To the southeast is one who
 channels the power of the Fighting type.{VAR BE01}
 To the northwest is one who
 has mastered the Dark type.{VAR BE01}
 To the northeast is one who
 knows the mind of the Psychic type.{VAR BE01}
 If you can defeat these warriors with
 your courage and wisdom,{VAR BE00}
 you shall be led to the summit,{VAR BE00}
 where the strongest Champion awaits."
